{
    "title": "DraftKings Pick6: Fantasy Game",
    "description": "Introducing DraftKings Pick6\u2014the simplest way to get fantasy action on your favorite sports, including NFL football, NBA basketball, NHL hockey, MLB baseball UFC, NASCAR and PGA TOUR \ud83c\udfc0 \ud83c\udfc8\ud83c\udfd2 \ud83c\udfce\r\n\r\nDraftKings Pick6 is currently available in Alabama, Alaska, Arizona, Arkansas, California, Delaware, Georgia, Indiana, Massachusetts, Minnesota, Missouri, Nebraska, New Hampshire, New Mexico, North Carolina, North Dakota, Oklahoma, Rhode Island, South Carolina, South Dakota, Tennessee, Texas, Utah, Vermont, Virginia, Washington D.C., West Virginia, and Wisconsin. Please continue to check back for updates! \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\r\n\r\nMore Fun, Less Time\r\n\r\nPick6 is a peer-to-peer, stat-based fantasy sports game that offers a simple & fun daily fantasy sports experience and caters to everyone \u2013 from the hardcore fantasy NFL football enthusiast to the casual sports fan! Pick 2+ athletes from multiple NFL football, MLB baseball, PGA TOUR golf, UFC, NASCAR racing, NHL hockey or NBA basketball teams. Make \u2018more or less\u2019 predictions based on their athlete performance projections. Choose the dollar amount you want to play for and lock in your lineup picks to start playing. You will compete against other players for guaranteed cash prizes. Make enough correct picks and win a share of the prizes. \u2728\r\n\r\nMake Your Picks for:\r\n\u2013 NFL Football \ud83c\udfc8\r\n\u2013 MLB Baseball \u26be\r\n\u2013 NBA Basketball \ud83c\udfc0\r\n\u2013 NHL Hockey \ud83c\udfd2\r\n\u2013 PGA TOUR Golf \u26f3\r\n\u2013 UFC \ud83e\udd4a\r\n\u2013 NASCAR \ud83c\udfce\r\n\r\nSafe & Secure Withdrawals\r\n\r\nRest assured that DraftKings Pick6 employs the same advanced technology as our industry-leading daily fantasy sports game product, ensuring your picks are made with confidence and your information remains safe and secure. \ud83d\udd12 \u2705\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb0 Select Your Picks, Watch, and Win Cash \ud83d\udcb0\r\n\r\nPlaying Pick6 on DraftKings is simple:\r\nPick \u201cMore\u201d or \u201cLess\u201d on 2+ athlete projections \u2195\ufe0f\r\nChoose your entry fee amount & lock in your MLB baseball, NFL football, NBA basketball, PGA TOUR golf, UFC, NASCAR & NHL hockey picks \ud83d\udd12\r\nTrack your lineup against others live once the sporting event begins \ud83d\udd34 \ud83d\udfe0 \ud83d\udfe2\r\nView final results daily & collect real cash prizes and payouts! \ud83d\udcb0\u2728\r\n\r\n\u2014\r\n\r\nThe maximum number of Picks allowed varies by contest. Estimated Prizing is an approximation calculated by taking the average percentage of entries from contests of the same type that finished in prize positions (\u201cAverage Win Rate\u201d) during internal product beta testing over a seven week period (\"Beta Test\"), applying it to the contest prize structure and multiplying by your Entry Fees. This calculation represents the average results for each prize position for a participant with your Entry Fees during the Beta Test. This calculation assumes that every contest you enter will reach its maximum entry capacity by the contest start time. Estimated Prizing amounts are not a guaranteed prediction of future results or the minimum prize commitment. Actual prizes awarded are based on contest results.\r\n\r\nThis is a real-money fantasy app. Please gamble responsibly and only bet what you can afford. Call 1-800-GAMBLER/ 1-800-522-4700 or visit or visit https://www.ncpgambling.org/. Help is available for problem gambling. Call (888) 789-7777 or visit ccpg.org (CT).\r\n18+ in most eligible jurisdictions, but other age and eligibility restrictions may apply. Pick6 not available everywhere, including, but not limited to NY and CA-ONT (for up-to-date list of jurisdictions please visit pick6.draftkings.com/where-is-pick6-available). Void where prohibited. See terms at pick6.draftkings.com.\r\n\r\nPick6 Credits are site credits that are single-use, non-cashable, non-refundable, cannot be withdrawn, and subject to expiration restrictions. Promotion eligibility, deposit, and play restrictions may apply. To learn more about current promotions and associated terms, see Pick6.draftkings.com/promos.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Introducing DraftKings Pick6\u2014the simplest way to get fantasy action on your favorite sports, including NFL football, NBA basketball, NHL hockey, MLB baseball UFC, NASCAR and PGA TOUR \ud83c\udfc0 \ud83c\udfc8\ud83c\udfd2 \ud83c\udfce<br><br>DraftKings Pick6 is currently available in Alabama, Alaska, Arizona, Arkansas, California, Delaware, Georgia, Indiana, Massachusetts, Minnesota, Missouri, Nebraska, New Hampshire, New Mexico, North Carolina, North Dakota, Oklahoma, Rhode Island, South Carolina, South Dakota, Tennessee, Texas, Utah, Vermont, Virginia, Washington D.C., West Virginia, and Wisconsin. Please continue to check back for updates! \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8<br><br>More Fun, Less Time<br><br>Pick6 is a peer-to-peer, stat-based fantasy sports game that offers a simple &amp; fun daily fantasy sports experience and caters to everyone \u2013 from the hardcore fantasy NFL football enthusiast to the casual sports fan! Pick 2+ athletes from multiple NFL football, MLB baseball, PGA TOUR golf, UFC, NASCAR racing, NHL hockey or NBA basketball teams. Make \u2018more or less\u2019 predictions based on their athlete performance projections. Choose the dollar amount you want to play for and lock in your lineup picks to start playing. You will compete against other players for guaranteed cash prizes. Make enough correct picks and win a share of the prizes. \u2728<br><br>Make Your Picks for:<br>\u2013 NFL Football \ud83c\udfc8<br>\u2013 MLB Baseball \u26be<br>\u2013 NBA Basketball \ud83c\udfc0<br>\u2013 NHL Hockey \ud83c\udfd2<br>\u2013 PGA TOUR Golf \u26f3<br>\u2013 UFC \ud83e\udd4a<br>\u2013 NASCAR \ud83c\udfce<br><br>Safe &amp; Secure Withdrawals<br><br>Rest assured that DraftKings Pick6 employs the same advanced technology as our industry-leading daily fantasy sports game product, ensuring your picks are made with confidence and your information remains safe and secure. \ud83d\udd12 \u2705<br><br>\ud83d\udcb0 Select Your Picks, Watch, and Win Cash \ud83d\udcb0<br><br>Playing Pick6 on DraftKings is simple:<br>Pick \u201cMore\u201d or \u201cLess\u201d on 2+ athlete projections \u2195\ufe0f<br>Choose your entry fee amount &amp; lock in your MLB baseball, NFL football, NBA basketball, PGA TOUR golf, UFC, NASCAR &amp; NHL hockey picks \ud83d\udd12<br>Track your lineup against others live once the sporting event begins \ud83d\udd34 \ud83d\udfe0 \ud83d\udfe2<br>View final results daily &amp; collect real cash prizes and payouts! \ud83d\udcb0\u2728<br><br>\u2014<br><br>The maximum number of Picks allowed varies by contest. Estimated Prizing is an approximation calculated by taking the average percentage of entries from contests of the same type that finished in prize positions (\u201cAverage Win Rate\u201d) during internal product beta testing over a seven week period (&quot;Beta Test&quot;), applying it to the contest prize structure and multiplying by your Entry Fees. This calculation represents the average results for each prize position for a participant with your Entry Fees during the Beta Test. This calculation assumes that every contest you enter will reach its maximum entry capacity by the contest start time. Estimated Prizing amounts are not a guaranteed prediction of future results or the minimum prize commitment. Actual prizes awarded are based on contest results.<br><br>This is a real-money fantasy app. Please gamble responsibly and only bet what you can afford. Call 1-800-GAMBLER/ 1-800-522-4700 or visit or visit https://www.ncpgambling.org/. Help is available for problem gambling. Call (888) 789-7777 or visit ccpg.org (CT).<br>18+ in most eligible jurisdictions, but other age and eligibility restrictions may apply. Pick6 not available everywhere, including, but not limited to NY and CA-ONT (for up-to-date list of jurisdictions please visit pick6.draftkings.com/where-is-pick6-available). Void where prohibited. See terms at pick6.draftkings.com.<br><br>Pick6 Credits are site credits that are single-use, non-cashable, non-refundable, cannot be withdrawn, and subject to expiration restrictions. Promotion eligibility, deposit, and play restrictions may apply. To learn more about current promotions and associated terms, see Pick6.draftkings.com/promos.",
